- That unit is **unengaged**. 
- That unit was not set up on the battlefield this turn. 
- No model in that unit has moved more than 3&quot; this turn.</description></rule></rules><profiles><profile id="95b8-61a6-b225-fe78" name="Doomsday cannon" hidden="false" typeId="f77d-b953-8fa4-b762" typeName="Ranged Weapons" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Range" typeId="9896-9419-16a1-92fc">72&quot;</characteristic><characteristic name="A" typeId="3bb-c35f-f54-fb08">D6+1</characteristic><characteristic name="BS" typeId="94d-8a98-cf90-183e">3+</characteristic><characteristic name="S" typeId="2229-f494-25db-c5d3">18</characteristic><characteristic name="AP" typeId="9ead-8a10-520-de15">-4</characteristic><characteristic name="D" typeId="a354-c1c8-a745-f9e3">4</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="7f1b-8591-2fcf-d01c">Blast, Heavy, Assault</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles></selection><selection id="mhskpsg" name="Gauss flayer array" entryId="166f-78e9-3ef-63a0::c9e6-b252-d410-4ce3" entryGroupId="166f-78e9-3ef-63a0::ebdd-e4b1-1d7e-94c3" number="2" type="upgrade" from="group" group="Wargear"><rules><rule id="d1d1-611e-5191-1095" name="Lethal Hits" hidden="false" page="25"><description>Each time an attack made with a **[LETHAL HITS]** weapon results in a **critical hit**, you can choose for that attack to automatically wound the target. 
***Designer’s Note:** Choosing to automatically wound the target means that no **wound roll** is made for that attack. You may decide against this, as it means that attack cannot result in a **critical wound** and so cannot trigger other abilities such as [DEVASTATING WOUNDS].*</description></rule><rule id="c5c8-8b58-b8b6-7786" name="Rapid Fire" hidden="false" page="25"><description>This ability always takes the form **[RAPID FIRE X]**. Each time you gather **attack dice** for a **[RAPID FIRE]** weapon, add **X** additional **attack dice** if the target unit was within half range of that weapon in the Select Targets step. 
***Example:** If a **[RAPID FIRE 1]** weapon with an **A** characteristic of 1 targets a unit that is within half range, you would gather one additional **attack dice** for that weapon (for a total of two for that weapon).*</description></rule></rules><profiles><profile id="5758-94f7-19de-b941" name="Gauss flayer array" hidden="false" typeId="f77d-b953-8fa4-b762" typeName="Ranged Weapons" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Range" typeId="9896-9419-16a1-92fc">24&quot;</characteristic><characteristic name="A" typeId="3bb-c35f-f54-fb08">5</characteristic><characteristic name="BS" typeId="94d-8a98-cf90-183e">3+</characteristic><characteristic name="S" typeId="2229-f494-25db-c5d3">4</characteristic><characteristic name="AP" typeId="9ead-8a10-520-de15">0</characteristic><characteristic name="D" typeId="a354-c1c8-a745-f9e3">1</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="7f1b-8591-2fcf-d01c">Lethal Hits, Rapid Fire 5, Assault</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles></selection></selections><costs><cost name="pts" typeId="51b2-306e-1021-d207" value="200" /></costs><categories><category id="ee0-cf31-4fb5-6b26" name="Faction: Necrons" entryId="ee0-cf31-4fb5-6b26" primary="false" /><category id="dbd4-63-af05-998" entryId="dbd4-63-af05-998" name="Vehicle" primary="true" /><category id="c619-2086-bbcf-69c9" name="Fly" entryId="c619-2086-bbcf-69c9" primary="false" /><category id="7925-76e2-7700-68e4" name="Doomsday Ark" entryId="7925-76e2-7700-68e4" primary="false" /><category id="b927-8eeb-7cc3-8dec" name="Frame" entryId="b927-8eeb-7cc3-8dec" primary="false" /></categories></selection></selections><categories><category name="Uncategorized" id="7z6z2qnc" primary="false" entryId="(No Category)" /><category name="Configuration" id="eyb60h" primary="false" entryId="4ac9-fd30-1e3d-b249" /><category name="Epic Hero" id="ld532or" primary="false" entryId="4f3a-f0f7-6647-348d" /><category name="Character" id="ld0okb" primary="false" entryId="9cfd-1c32-585f-7d5c" /><category name="Battleline" id="ldbiea1c" primary="false" entryId="e338-111e-d0c6-b687" /><category name="Infantry" id="80ifsao" primary="false" entryId="cf47-a0d7-7207-29dc" /><category name="Swarm" id="8167h1aah" primary="false" entryId="b00b-5bae-444f-964e" /><category name="Mounted" id="leetrcl" primary="false" entryId="14a0-40c9-2748-ae6e" /><category name="Beast" id="lebbvs7" primary="false" entryId="4c3e-9310-a516-3590" /><category name="Monster" id="81tr2y7" primary="false" entryId="9693-cf84-fe69-37a9" /><category name="Vehicle" id="leluqyk" primary="false" entryId="dbd4-63-af05-998" /><category name="Drone" id="82dycq" primary="false" entryId="2471-e2e0-3f55-d6cb" /><category name="Dedicated Transport" id="82ws4qb" primary="false" entryId="ba07-411c-2832-1f79" /><category name="Fortification" id="821jh5" primary="false" entryId="19d7-9c74-2140-5851" /><category name="Unit" id="823w5d7" primary="false" entryId="1160-70ae-a862-b1a8" /><category name="Allies: Adeptus Titanicus" id="82wfzlf" primary="false" entryId="9988-6b5e-660e-d973" /><category name="Allies: Astra Militarum" id="83p8ubc" primary="false" entryId="8247-35f6-ec2a-7caa" /><category name="Allies: Chaos Knights" id="83icuu" primary="false" entryId="8dd6-af11-abd3-55f1" /><category name="Allies: Deathwatch" id="83jb20r" primary="false" entryId="8886-848f-a0f9-1e19" /><category name="Allies: Heretic Astartes" id="83tytk3" primary="false" entryId="92e6-f82e-0a48-2276" /><category name="Allies: Imperial Agents" id="83l0v2" primary="false" entryId="742f-5727-1bc9-6da5" /><category name="Allies: Imperial Knights" id="83ivv21" primary="false" entryId="5e03-9044-273d-e818" /><category name="Allies: Legiones Daemonica" id="84o0ph4" primary="false" entryId="e1ea-71b9-f0ef-d788" /><category name="Allies: Titanicus Traitoris" id="84vsorl" primary="false" entryId="24fa-8caf-cd68-31fb" /><category name="Allies: Tyranids" id="84qf6ud" primary="false" entryId="747a-c6a9-6f4f-7f09" /><category name="Allies: Unaligned Forces" id="8413hwv" primary="false" entryId="07d9-ab1c-cf28-0939" /><category name="Reference" id="84pf8t2" primary="false" entryId="eef1-be80-500a-edfc" /><category name="Illegal Units" id="8431l6" primary="false" entryId="(Illegal Units)" /></categories></force></forces></roster>